    "story": "The hill is not a big hill, but the packs make it bigger, and the rifles make it bigger still, and the grass is tall enough to hide the ground under their boots. The man in front knows where the top is and the man behind him trusts him to know it, and the third man carries the shovel, because somebody has to dig once they get there. The sky is full of clouds and the clouds are full of weather and the weather is coming, and the hill has to be taken before it gets here.",
