    "story": "The balloon is still on the ground and the ground is where it is not supposed to be, and the men are working the lines because the sky will not wait for them to be ready. The hedgehogs are scattered and the sand is everywhere and the gantry leans in the middle of it all, and the afternoon is the wrong time to be doing this in the open. They pull because the balloon has to go up before the planes come over, and the planes do not send word ahead of time. The protection goes up in the air, and the men go down in the sand, and the beach does the rest.",
