    "story": "Five men, and only one of them knows where the cover is. That's the arrangement — the front man picks the line across the open, and the rest lend him their trust at a dead run, because out here trust is just another word for keeping up. The sea that delivered them is already forgetting them. Ahead is a fold in the ground, a wall, a shadow — something the front man saw from the water and is now spending everybody's legs to reach. If he's wrong, he's wrong for all five. He runs like a man who knows it.",
