    "description": "Soldiers and sailors crowd the open ramp of a landing craft on a grey sea in this painterly World War II fine art photograph from the Facing History War series in color. A sailor at the ramp's edge raises an arm to signal the column behind him, the men in helmets and packs packed tight between the steel sides, in the last still moment before the beach.",
