    "description": "Soldiers cross a sandy embankment in this painterly World War II fine art photograph from the Facing History War series in color. A man walks upright through the drifting dust with his rifle across his body, a comrade kneels aiming a pistol at his side, and a fallen soldier lies at the edge of the frame — the advance, still moving.",
