    "description": "A soldier in a net-covered helmet runs forward across muddy ground in this painterly World War II fine art photograph from the Facing History War series in color. Rifle held across his body, pack heavy on his back, he leads the advance while comrades aim and crouch behind him — the war, at a run.",
