    "story": "Boots on a dirt road make a sound like a slow argument, and theirs had been arguing since before the light. The man in the middle carried the machine pistol across his body the way a waiter carries a tray — long practice, no attention left in it. In the ditch, the ones who had sat down watched them pass with the flat eyes of men spending their strength wisely. Nobody waved. Waving belonged to a different war, or an earlier month of this one. The road ran straight enough to show them their own future: more road. He walked in the print of the man ahead and saved his looking for the crossroads, where looking would be owed.",
