    "story": "The field had a fold in it. Five men went into the fold, and the fold kept them. The man on the right fired first. He did not wait for the word. The word came after, once, from the sergeant, and it was his name. He grinned at that. A man does not hear his own name often here. The grass was high enough to hide a man. It was not high enough to hide a sound. The rifles spoke one after the other, and then together. The crack rolled across the field and came back off the trees. The line fired again.",
