    "story": "If the tank stopped, the men would stop. The tank did not stop. It ground forward through the dust. The grinding sat in their chests. The men ran beside the steel. They did not look at the steel. They looked at the dust ahead, and the dust ahead gave them nothing. Somewhere ahead, beyond the trees, a town waited. The town had a name. None of them knew it. The tank's engine changed its note. The treads kept their own time, slow and steady, and the men kept that time with their boots.",
